<title>USA: Banc One Corp Q2 oper shr up.</title>
<headline>Banc One Corp Q2 oper shr up.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr			  $0.67		    $0.66</p>
<p> Oper net			391,600		  395,200</p>
<p>			    6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr			  $1.40		    $1.35</p>
<p> Oper net			826,500		  818,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: '97 Q2 excludes $467 million pretax charges from acquisition of Liberty Bancorp and impact of accounting adjustment from securitization gains.</p>
<p>Q2 net income $0.02/shr vs $0.66, after charges.</p>
